{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is a first-person arena battler, boasting brutal melee combat, branching paths, and a menagerie of bloodthirsty opponents - from vicious wild beasts to brutal barbarians. Take your combatant through multiple arenas on your quest for freedom and valour - and give your callous crowd a show they\u2019ll never forget.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Rags to Roma - </strong>Rise through the ranks of the gladiatorial circuit to become the land\u2019s most fearsome fighter, starting as a lowly slave and slowly becoming the ultimate period pugilist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blades, Blood, and Broadswords</strong> - Wield maces, longswords, spears and hammers with the age-authentic arsenal you\u2019ve come to expect from DOSMan games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rend and Repeat - </strong>Branching paths and randomised weapon drops make for an unpredictable - and highly replayable - rampage through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Match Made in Hell - </strong>From one-on-one battles to high-intensity gauntlets, the rules of the ring are always evolving - so pick your battles wisely.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mettle Meets Metal - </strong>Rock out to a punchy Metal-coded acoustic OST by Bret Ware - guitarist and vocalist of UK metal band ZILF.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is another bite-sized brawler from the folk at DOSMan games, combining their trademark pixel art, unforgettable soundtrack, and pick-up-and-play mentality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/fa9282b69eb247848d284314100f7a81cf6021e5.jpg"},{"name":"Up and Comer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/2cf593cc4162fe871fdad895dddfe8d204dd19c3.jpg"},{"name":"Move on Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/a3778a0bd8472a9635f02be4e69b7353af4188c5.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing's Gonna Stop Us Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/346987319c95b25568189715b063156f2458f9fa.jpg"},{"name":"King of the Pits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/88ea7cbfed2122ae77d71f610a9486daca58de50.jpg"},{"name":"Crowd's Favor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/9d94f02905ba161a6dfbecfca8f94dae94666871.jpg"},{"name":"No Mercy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/44ce135bccfa5d94ca441046a5827894ebbe0f6f.jpg"},{"name":"Bittersweet Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/499c0807c250a69a47cda5bdb3d855d5dbe44a96.jpg"},{"name":"Breaker of Chains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/a74f15061917d311f45ab1ddc9395089854dc49e.jpg"},{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777500/3744931d9f1cfbeedf9fc64f49acf12c111bbb22.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777500?t=1772097292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777500?t=1772097292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777500/948d228ec3725d3477ec3738bbd287bbf4d52f99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772097292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777500/948d228ec3725d3477ec3738bbd287bbf4d52f99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772097292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is a first-person arena battler, boasting brutal melee combat, branching paths, and a menagerie of bloodthirsty opponents - from vicious wild beasts to brutal barbarians. Take your combatant through multiple arenas on your quest for freedom and valour - and give your callous crowd a show they\u2019ll never forget.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Rags to Roma - </strong>Rise through the ranks of the gladiatorial circuit to become the land\u2019s most fearsome fighter, starting as a lowly slave and slowly becoming the ultimate period pugilist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blades, Blood, and Broadswords</strong> - Wield maces, longswords, spears and hammers with the age-authentic arsenal you\u2019ve come to expect from DOSMan games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rend and Repeat - </strong>Branching paths and randomised weapon drops make for an unpredictable - and highly replayable - rampage through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Match Made in Hell - </strong>From one-on-one battles to high-intensity gauntlets, the rules of the ring are always evolving - so pick your battles wisely.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mettle Meets Metal - </strong>Rock out to a punchy Metal-coded acoustic OST by Bret Ware - guitarist and vocalist of UK metal band ZILF.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodmatch is another bite-sized brawler from the folk at DOSMan games, combining their trademark pixel art, unforgettable soundtrack, and pick-up-and-play mentality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DOSMan Games"],"dlc":[4309560],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777500/8745cdb07bcd740018ee589376872d148c2e638a/header.jpg?t=1772097292","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777500/265366708/7a4efd89c78373d33e09a47a11c5b7620aa4b4c5/1764792476/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764792886","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777500/265366708/7a4efd89c78373d33e09a47a11c5b7620aa4b4c5/1764792476/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764792886","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777500/265366708/7a4efd89c78373d33e09a47a11c5b7620aa4b4c5/1764792476/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764792886","id":257196974,"name":"Release Window Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196974/9e8b69513f2c002940ad46907484a2686d9e921d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764792886"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777500/1722981802/47c768912c85b0e2ae443905e9bbb8046773e870/1750373519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750930017","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777500/1722981802/47c768912c85b0e2ae443905e9bbb8046773e870/1750373519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750930017","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777500/1722981802/47c768912c85b0e2ae443905e9bbb8046773e870/1750373519/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750930017","id":257149800,"name":"Reveal","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app